# Keep the Docker build context small. The image (Dockerfile in this dir) only
# COPYs config.yml + start.sh — but a developer who followed this folder's README
# has a multi-GB `czech-republic-latest.osm.pbf` and a `graph-cache/` here (both
# git-ignored). `.gitignore` does NOT affect the Docker build context — only
# `.dockerignore` does — so without this every local/registry build would upload
# gigabytes and can time out. Mirrors infra/graphhopper/.gitignore's graph data.
*.osm.pbf
*.osm
graph-cache/
